zYwI","user":{"login":"MileyHollenberg","id":799917,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5OTkxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/799917?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg","html_url":"https://github.com/MileyHollenberg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-29T20:49:14Z","updated_at":"2025-07-29T20:49:14Z","body":"Seems like this could be a zip align issue, https://stackoverflow.com/questions/55173004/targeting-sdk-android-q-results-in-failed-to-finalize-session-install-failed-i, could you try adding `android:extractNativeLibs=\"true\"` to the AndroidManifest.xml's application tag? I'll also try this out tomorrow on 4.5-dev5 on my Android devices","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3134032904/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3134596363","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108842#issuecomment-3134596363","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108842","id":3134596363,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc661iUL","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-30T01:40:33Z","updated_at":"2025-07-30T01:40:33Z","body":"I'm getting these errors in logcat:\n\n```\n07-29 22:22:59.485  1295  1959 E NativeLibraryHelper: Library 'libmono-component-marshal-ilgen-static.a' is not page-aligned - will not be able to open it directly from apk.\n07-29 22:22:59.485  1295  1959 W NativeHelper: Failure copying native libraries [errorCode=-2]\n07-29 22:22:59.485  1295  1959 E PackageInstallerSession: Commit of session 919873961 failed: Failed to extract native libraries, res=-2\n```\n\nSo I think you may be correct about zip align. It could have been introduced by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106148 which was merged between dev3 and dev4. It looks like that PR changes the [padding calculation](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106148/files#diff-01204824da135287ab10a6f366539ea4ca11adac09dfc10766999b29e980c733R3986-R3991) for `.so` files and maybe that also has to apply to `.a` and maybe other files as well. cc @m4gr3d ","author_a