ss\nOppo A53s - Android 10 - FAIL\n```\n\nOnly device I had issues on was my Oppo A53s running Android 10, the Huwawei device mentioned in the issue can only go up to Android 9 (though it could still be on Android 8.1 as well) so this issue might be specific devices running Android 10 or below.\n\nI tried all the potential fixes mentioned in the stackoverflow link I added but none of them worked. Wasn't able to get any new logs either (they were all similar to @raulsntos 's logs)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3135155264/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3135186672","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108842#issuecomment-3135186672","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108842","id":3135186672,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc663ybw","user":{"login":"Vladohud","id":20769455,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzY5NDU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20769455?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vladohud","html_url":"https://github.com/Vladohud","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vladohud/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vladohud/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vladohud/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vladohud/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vladohud/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vladohud/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vladohud/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vladohud/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vladohud/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","si