ns":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3167741963/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3167893355","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108842#issuecomment-3167893355","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108842","id":3167893355,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc680jdr","user":{"login":"MileyHollenberg","id":799917,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5OTkxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/799917?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg","html_url":"https://github.com/MileyHollenberg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T13:22:08Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T13:22:08Z","body":"Tried it, but no difference unfortunately. It still throws the same error","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3167893355/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168852128","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108842#issuecomment-3168852128","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108842","id":3168852128,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc684Nig","user":{"login":"h1v9","id":17818610,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3ODE4NjEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17818610?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9","html_url":"https://github.com/h1v9","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T17:50:32Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T21:06:59Z","body":"Got the same problem with beta5 installing on a Galaxy S24 Ultra.\nAndroid studio reports all kinds of alignment errors in its apk analysis \nSeems to be related to the page size of mono libraries https://developer.android.com/guide/practices/page-sizes\n\n<img width=\"1965\" height=\"718\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ad5ba792-4971-4a81-a679-9e0eee471b32\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168852128/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3170646752","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108842#issuecomment-3170646752","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108842","id":3170646752,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68_Drg","user":{"login":"h1v9","id":17818610,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3ODE4NjEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17818610?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9","html_url":"https://github.com/h1v9","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-09T11:41:51Z","updated_at":"2025-08-09T12:04:14Z","body":"The problem seem to be that the .net libraries from the SDK do not support 16K Paging.\nEven updating .net sdk to the latest version (8.0.413) did not fix the issue even tho the PR https://github.com/dotnet/runtime/pull/104577 has been merged almost a year ago.\n\nThe libs are definitely aligned to 4k pages as on MacOS I get:\n```\n$ greadelf -l \"/usr/local/share/dotnet/packs/Microsoft.NETCore.App.Runtime.Mono.android-arm64/8.0.19/runtimes/android-arm64/native/libSystem.Native.so\" | grep -A1 LOAD\n  LOAD           0x0000000000000000 0x0000000000000000 0x0000000000000000\n                 0x0000000000017240 0x0000000000017240  R E    0x1000\n  LOAD           0x0000000000017240 0x0000000000018240 0x0000000000018240\n                 0x0000000000000820 0x0000000000000dc0  RW     0x1000\n  LOAD           0x0000000000017a60 0x0000000000019a60 0x0000000000019a60\n                 0x000000000000005e 0x00000000000001c0  RW     0x1000\n```\n\nAny solution?\n\nEdit: Nevermind, running `adb shell getconf PAGE_SIZE` on the S24 Ultra returns 4096, so it should've installed? (Android 15)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3170646752/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172013600","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108842#issuecomment-3172013600","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108842","id":3172013600,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69ERYg","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-09T18:27:31Z","updated_at":"2025-08-09T18:27:31Z","body":"@h1v9 The PR you mentioned doesn't seem to be backported to .NET 8, so it would only apply to .NET 9 and newer. Unfortunately, non-gradle exports only support .NET 8 so you can't easily test if it fixes the issue. In my testing it doesn't seem to fix it.\n\nGradle exports seem to work fine even with .NET 8, testing with a Godot build from `master`.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172013600/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3175435348","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108842#issuecomment-3175435348","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108842","id":3175435348,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69RUxU","user":{"login":"h1v9","id":17818610,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3ODE4NjEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17818610?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9","html_url":"https://github.com/h1v9","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h1v9/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-11T15:44:15Z","updated_at":"2025-08-11T15:44:15Z","body":"> [@h1v9](https://github.com/h1v9) The PR you mentioned doesn't seem to be backported to .NET 8, so it would only apply to .NET 9 and newer. Unfortunately, non-gradle exports only support .NET 8 so you can't easily test if it fixes the issue. In my testing it doesn't seem to fix it.\n> \n> Gradle exports seem to work fine even with .NET 8, testing with a Godot build from `master`.\n\nGradle builds do work indeed.\n\nAnother weird thing I noticed with \"normal\" build is that the exported apk won't install with the normal package installer, only through adb. I could reproduce this with multiple projects and on multiple phones","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3175435348/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3218584875","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108842#issuecomment-3218584875","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108842","id":3218584875,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_17Ur","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-25T01:52:15Z","updated_at":"2025-08-25T01:52:15Z","body":"> Unfortunately, non-gradle exports only support .NET 8 so you can't easily test if it fixes the issue\n\n@raulsntos Is there a limitation to using non-gradle exports with .NET 9?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3218584875/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3218659968","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108842#issuecomment-3218659968","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108842","id":3218659968,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_2NqA","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-25T02:48:51Z","updated_at":"2025-08-25T02:48:51Z","body":"And to confirm @Vladohud, is the issue reproducible with gradle builds?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3218659968/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3218990188","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108842#issuecomment-3218990188","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108842","id":3218990188,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_3eRs","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-25T06:25:37Z","updated_at":"2025-08-25T06:25:37Z","body":"> > Unfortunately, non-gradle exports only support .NET 8 so you can't easily test if it fixes the issue\n>\n> @raulsntos Is there a limitation to using non-gradle exports with .NET 9?\n\nThe [`libSystem.Security.Cryptography.Native.Android.jar`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/modules/mono/thirdparty/libSystem.Security.Cryptography.Native.Android.jar) library we bundle with the export templates is sourced from .NET 8 and won't work for other versions. Replacing it with the one from .NET 9 would break .NET 8 support. So for non-gradle builds we require the C# project to target .NET 8.\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102627\n\nBut, as I mentioned earlier, I made a custom build to bypass this requirement and target .NET 9, but I could still reproduce the issue. So switching to .NET 9 doesn't seem to fix it. I don't think the issue is related to a specific .NET version.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3218990188/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3225594587","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108842#issuecomment-3225594587","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108842","id":3225594587,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7AQqrb","user":{"login":"Vladohud","id":20769455,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzY5NDU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20769455?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vladohud","html_url":"https://github.com/Vladohud","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vladohud/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vladohud/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vladohud/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vladohud/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vladohud/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vladohud/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vladohud/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vladohud/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vladohud/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-26T